{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_00_006_23_5_00_006_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:216303211631ca5b631b536eda7527cfef4d682400a074aa57ad4bd10cfb8e9a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_00_006_23_5_00_006_23:5_00_006_23:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fdc7b30c8a37ecc3ac75d0d6a774ec9cb94e0a3744592b2a07e7799a41bf940",
      "text": "各自的新年假期",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_006_23_5_00_006_23:5_00_006_23:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34e73cd896f66dd802cdba9d0abbc85b94874a2227efaa28d45e9d9882865b4c",
      "text": "迎来了新年的315 Production。\n偶像们换上崭新的心情，\n与制作人互致问候。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_006_23_5_00_006_23:5_00_006_23:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8212f0b2f5451b78f20777e424e07d9158784999659042aac746772f1c0815b",
      "text": "早上好，制作人。新年快乐！\n今天就开始新年开工了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_006_23_5_00_006_23:5_00_006_23:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc0f90ba4f45dc09649665bb655eb624df670c24ceb8b475276f65410d64a390",
      "text": "新年快乐。\n大家新年假期都有好好休息吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_006_23_5_00_006_23:5_00_006_23:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b568047332674d287032560265c84e80fbccc293bd8aada4491d2b6d17ea1281",
      "text": "我是跟姐姐和弟弟一起去抢新年首卖了，\n结果被挤得七荤八素的，可惨了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_006_23_5_00_006_23:5_00_006_23:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79ada4d1418bd728acf4336a6d2760c029a8d8a25342035c8452497a8e7c7aed",
      "text": "偏偏买到的福袋里还装了残次品。\n英雄先生和诚司先生过得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_006_23_5_00_006_23:5_00_006_23:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:343a5b37034d74671926564d8bb64e9eeec076941c9f03cd89bcac1661c22bc3",
      "text": "我那边啊，大年初一家里人聚在一起吃了年节料理。\n算是过年的固定惯例了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_006_23_5_00_006_23:5_00_006_23:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:006425fd33ee29c48d2d41a11a6288195318159143e7f79d0c5253219a43a496",
      "text": "我是和妹妹一家人一起去新年参拜了。\n那边也相当拥挤啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_006_23_5_00_006_23:5_00_006_23:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36c7cfed544f894192f2014aefbae2f922a2d58c5d1df95a43827071545a8b25",
      "text": "这样啊。\n看来大家都好好享受了新年假期呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_006_23_5_00_006_23:5_00_006_23:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c3b3b15a033d6d1652da37850fcdeacffdab6916909c5c0ed275df1075b0b19",
      "text": "去新年参拜的时候，我也祈愿了\nFRAME的工作能一切顺利。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_006_23_5_00_006_23:5_00_006_23:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38257a1f196e96caa3f208ce5a61260a8fdd95d2049de2368b2ec2ecd521adfb",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n好嘞——，今年做偶像也要加油啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_006_23_5_00_006_23:5_00_006_23:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b0977edce9a5fbc4dae0afcfd87ed618cbe0f36194bfe7a7c3f57ef1122f6ae",
      "text": "啊啊。今年也一起努力吧。\n制作人，今年也拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
